# Copy to `server/.env` and fill in what you need. Gitignored.
# Anything already set in the environment wins, so the app's own PORT /
# ADMIN_TOKEN / CONFIG_DB are never overridden from here.
#
# See docs/integrations.md for what each of these is and how to get one.

# --- GitHub -----------------------------------------------------------------
# Not needed if you've run `gh auth login` on this machine.
# GH_TOKEN=

# --- Slack ------------------------------------------------------------------
# A user token (xoxp-) sees your DMs and private channels and posts as you;
# a bot token (xoxb-) only sees what it's been invited to, and can't search
# at all — so the recent-messages feed needs xoxp-.
# SLACK_TOKEN=
#
# Conversations the feed should skip, in case Slack won't tell us what you've
# muted (the endpoint that knows isn't a public one). Merged with whatever it
# does manage to report.
# SLACK_MUTED=C0123ABCD,C0456EFGH

# --- Claude (cloud sessions, via routines) ----------------------------------
# `claude setup-token` mints the token.
# CLAUDE_CODE_OAUTH_TOKEN=
# CLAUDE_ENVIRONMENT_ID=
# CLAUDE_DEFAULT_REPO=aatack/odds-and-ends
# CLAUDE_DEFAULT_MODEL=claude-sonnet-5
# CLAUDE_CODE_API_BASE_URL=https://api.anthropic.com

# --- Server -----------------------------------------------------------------
# Settable here too, for a server started by hand rather than by the app.
# PORT=4000
# HOST=127.0.0.1
# ADMIN_TOKEN=
# CONFIG_DB=./data/config.db
